<p> Maize     3,782   98.1 (99.6)     n/a    n/a   (n/a)    (n/a)</p>
<p> Soybeans  6,412   99.0 (97.4)     n/a    n/a   (n/a)    (n/a)</p>
<p> Sunflower 3,039   99.4 (99.7)     n/a    n/a   (n/a)    (n/a)</p>
